  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Financial Information\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nWisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nExposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nRemoval Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n\n##### Patient Information\n\n\n\n##### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\nOur fees are based upon a combination of our costs, our time and our constant dedication to providing our patients with the highest quality dental care. The treatment recommended by our surgeons are never based on what your insurance company will pay as your treatment should not be governed by your insurance contract. We are in network providers for a few dental PPO insurance plans, please call us for details.\n\nWe do NOT accept or bill for any HMO, Medi-Cal or Denti-Cal insurance plans. If you have dental benefits with an insurance company we are not in network with, we will submit a claim on your behalf, so that your insurance company can reimburse you directly. Therefore, payment is due at the time service is rendered.\n\nFor your convenience, we accept cash, check, Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Discover. While we do not provide any direct payment plan options for service rendered, we do accept CareCredit, which you can apply for online.\n\nPlease take the time to review your insurance contract and plan benefits thoroughly so we may best serve you. If you have any questions regarding our financial policy, please contact us at (310) 315-1034- Click To Call. Many times, a simple telephone call can clear up any misunderstandings.\n\n\n### Medicare\n\n\nDental services are not covered by Medicare. Our surgeons are NOT providers for Medicare and therefore, cannot submit a claim for service rendered. If you feel your surgery would be eligible for coverage and you desire to obtain Medicare benefits, you have the option of selecting a Medicare provider/participant at another office or facility. Please remember that you are fully responsible for all fees charged by our office, regardless of your insurance coverage.\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
